    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1813170/extras/41e74d6174f27267a8bcdf87c8204646.avif?t=1752705102\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Co-Op Story Mode</h2><br><strong>Explore Echofield</strong><br>   \u27a2 Explore an immersive open-world with up to 6 players and uncover the dark history of Echofield. Make sure not to get caught by whatever might be lurking there\u2026<br><br><strong>Proximity Voice Chat</strong><br>   \u27a2 Fully immerse yourself by using the in-game proximity voice chat.<br><br><strong>Uncover Lost Lore</strong><br>   \u27a2 Find items that shed light on the happenings of Echofield and piece together the story.<br><br><strong>Interactive World</strong><br>   \u27a2 The Surrounded world is fully dynamic and explorable, you can access every single door, interact with most items, and a lot more.<br><br><strong>The Creature AI</strong><br>   \u27a2  Our creatures react to sounds they hear! Make sure to stay quiet while you search and explore the huge open-world map that awaits you!<br><br><strong>And so, so much more.</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1813170/extras/e7c066ff0d1de298ddc71dad56c91196.avif?t=1752705102\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Replayable mode \u201cHunted\u201d</h2><br><strong>Explore Abandoned Locations</strong><br>   \u27a2 Raise the stakes in the replayable gamemode \u201cHunted\u201d with up to 4 players. Infuse syringes with the black matter that has infested the asylum and banish the monster roaming these long forgotten halls\u2026<br><br><strong>Level Up</strong><br>   \u27a2 Collect XP and level up by playing \u201cHunted\u201d. Earn rewards, levels, tags and more!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1813170/extras/a712878fb084f79ef4c61496364871ca.avif?t=1752705102\" /></div><br>30 years ago, a remote laboratory researching black matter and dark energy had a complete system meltdown, causing it, and the surrounding forest &amp; village to become affected. Back then the government sent in agents to survey the destruction and to check for survivors. They were never seen or heard from again. Eventually the government sent agents to contain any possible infection, sealing off the area and warning any remaining residents to never enter this place.<br><br>Today, 30 years later, you and your friends heard rumors of monsters roaming these woods. Rumors of shadows lurking in the woods, of eerie sounds coming from the ground\u2026 But you, my friend, are facing that danger with your friends, head on. Go my friend, prove that you are in fact, not Surrounded by monsters lurking in the dark.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Discord Server</h2><br>The discord server will contain everything you need to know about this game, including sneak peeks while the game is in early development.<br>Any of your questions can be answered, and you\u2019re also able to give us some of your ideas on what you\u2019d like to see in the game. <br>Come talk to us here: ",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1813170/extras/41e74d6174f27267a8bcdf87c8204646.avif?t=1752705102\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Co-Op Story Mode</h2><br><strong>Explore Echofield</strong><br>   \u27a2 Explore an immersive open-world with up to 6 players and uncover the dark history of Echofield. Make sure not to get caught by whatever might be lurking there\u2026<br><br><strong>Proximity Voice Chat</strong><br>   \u27a2 Fully immerse yourself by using the in-game proximity voice chat.<br><br><strong>Uncover Lost Lore</strong><br>   \u27a2 Find items that shed light on the happenings of Echofield and piece together the story.<br><br><strong>Interactive World</strong><br>   \u27a2 The Surrounded world is fully dynamic and explorable, you can access every single door, interact with most items, and a lot more.<br><br><strong>The Creature AI</strong><br>   \u27a2  Our creatures react to sounds they hear! Make sure to stay quiet while you search and explore the huge open-world map that awaits you!<br><br><strong>And so, so much more.</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1813170/extras/e7c066ff0d1de298ddc71dad56c91196.avif?t=1752705102\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Replayable mode \u201cHunted\u201d</h2><br><strong>Explore Abandoned Locations</strong><br>   \u27a2 Raise the stakes in the replayable gamemode \u201cHunted\u201d with up to 4 players. Infuse syringes with the black matter that has infested the asylum and banish the monster roaming these long forgotten halls\u2026<br><br><strong>Level Up</strong><br>   \u27a2 Collect XP and level up by playing \u201cHunted\u201d. Earn rewards, levels, tags and more!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1813170/extras/a712878fb084f79ef4c61496364871ca.avif?t=1752705102\" /></div><br>30 years ago, a remote laboratory researching black matter and dark energy had a complete system meltdown, causing it, and the surrounding forest &amp; village to become affected. Back then the government sent in agents to survey the destruction and to check for survivors. They were never seen or heard from again. Eventually the government sent agents to contain any possible infection, sealing off the area and warning any remaining residents to never enter this place.<br><br>Today, 30 years later, you and your friends heard rumors of monsters roaming these woods. Rumors of shadows lurking in the woods, of eerie sounds coming from the ground\u2026 But you, my friend, are facing that danger with your friends, head on. Go my friend, prove that you are in fact, not Surrounded by monsters lurking in the dark.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Discord Server</h2><br>The discord server will contain everything you need to know about this game, including sneak peeks while the game is in early development.<br>Any of your questions can be answered, and you\u2019re also able to give us some of your ideas on what you\u2019d like to see in the game. <br>Come talk to us here: ",
    "short_description": "Explore a abandoned town, filled with mysteries and creatures capable of ending your life. Uncover what really happened. Dive into the story mode, or raise the stakes in the replayable gamemode 'Hunted'.",
